<title>USA: Bio-Plexus completes debenture financing.</title>
<headline>Bio-Plexus completes debenture financing.</headline>
<dateline>TOLLAND, Conn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Plexus Inc Thursday said it completed a financing for $5 million worth of convertible debentures through Shoreline Pacific Institutional Finance, the institutional division of Financial West Group.</p>
<p>Bio-Plexus said the debentures are being placed off-shore pursuant to a Regulation S financing.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, the debentures may be converted into common stock over time, Bio-Plexus said.</p>
<p>Bio-Plexus is a designer, developer, manufacturer and marketer of safety medical products.</p>
</text>
